# .gitignore — VRTelemetry
#
# Rules are grouped by *why* a path is excluded, not by tool. Every rule below
# corresponds to a path that actually occurs in this repository; speculative
# rules inherited from other projects have been removed (see VRT-2).
#
# The single most important rule in this file is the research-data block:
# recorded sessions contain special-category personal data and must never be
# committed. Enforced mechanically by tools/check_repo_hygiene.py.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Research data — NEVER COMMIT
# Recorded telemetry, subject audio, derived renders and the SQLite metadata
# stores that index them. These are the artefacts that were previously exposed
# in this repository's public history (see docs/incidents/).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Sessions/
Logs/
AppData/
CentralServer/
LicenseServer/
*.parquet
*.wav
*.db
*.sqlite3
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# TLS keys and certificates (GDPR-01). tools/generate_hub_certificate.py writes
# them under CentralServer/tls/, which is ignored above; this catches a copy
# made anywhere else in the tree. A leaked hub key lets anyone on the LAN
# impersonate the hub and receive participant data.
*.pem
*.key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
*.egg-info/
*.egg
.eggs/
develop-eggs/
dist/
sdist/
wheels/
.installed.cfg
MANIFEST

# Virtual environments
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

# Test & type-check caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Node / frontend
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.vite/
src/frontend/VRTelemetry/dist/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build outputs
#
# NOTE: build/ is deliberately NOT ignored wholesale. build/backend.spec is a
# tracked build *input* required by `npm run build:backend`; ignoring the whole
# directory is what silently excluded it and made `npm run package` impossible
# on any machine but the original author's. Only generated subdirectories are
# ignored here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/dist-backend/
build/work/
release/
apk/
*.rar
*.zip
*.exe
*.msi
*.dmg
*.AppImage

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets & local configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
config.toml
config.local.toml

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editors & OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Logs & scratch output
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
!doc/**/*.log

# Refactor scaffolding: the purged-history bundle and its runbook are
# working files, not project content. They exist to rewrite this repository;
# committing them into it defeats the purpose and adds 2.4 MB to every clone.
*.bundle
_purge/
_REFACTOR-STATUS.md
